{% if render_mode == "tton_gm" %}

#### Summary
{{ render_character_profile("bio_summary", actorUUID) }}
**Conception & Pregnancy Awareness:**
{% set actorName = decnpc(actorUUID).name %}
{% set isFemale = decnpc(actorUUID).isFemale %}
{% set ostimNetSettings = ostimnet_settings(player.UUID) %}
{% if ostimNetSettings.internalClimaxPromptCue and isFemale and is_plugin_loaded("Fertility Mode.esm") %}
    {% set fertilityRank = get_faction_rank(actorUUID, "ImmersiveEffectsFaction") %}
    {% if fertilityRank == 118 %}
    - **High chance of pregnancy (peak fertile days):** {{ actorName }} knows she is at her most fertile right now — finishing inside has a very high chance of getting her pregnant.
    {% elif fertilityRank == 117 %}
    - **Rising chance of pregnancy (fertile days approaching):** {{ actorName }} knows her fertile days are near — finishing inside could easily lead to pregnancy.
    {% elif fertilityRank == 116 or fertilityRank == 119 %}
    - **Safe days (cannot get pregnant):** {{ actorName }} knows it is her safe time of the month — finishing inside will not get her pregnant.
    {% elif fertilityRank >= 1 and fertilityRank <= 100 %}
    - **Already pregnant (cannot get pregnant again):** {{ actorName }} is already expecting a child — finishing inside will not get her pregnant again.
    {% elif fertilityRank >= 101 and fertilityRank <= 115 %}
    - **Recovering after birth (safe):** {{ actorName }} is still recovering from childbirth — she cannot get pregnant right now.
    {% elif fertilityRank == 120 %}
    - **In labor (safe):** {{ actorName }} is going into labor — there is no risk of pregnancy.
    {% endif %}
{% else %}
    - Sex and finishing inside can lead to pregnancy.
{% endif %}
